"}, {"path": "/@lmnoof/works/43", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/65aeebaa/uploads/origins/569a5b64-aef4-46d0-b4c3-821f7bb8dbe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99d778a88939d1374c0b5ef4a4debb3c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/65aeebaa/uploads/origins/569a5b64-aef4-46d0-b4c3-821f7bb8dbe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99d778a88939d1374c0b5ef4a4debb3c, https://si.imgix.net/65aeebaa/uploads/origins/569a5b64-aef4-46d0-b4c3-821f7bb8dbe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4b2d5f85c075be659dd69a5b5d971e62 2x, https://si.imgix.net/65aeebaa/uploads/origins/569a5b64-aef4-46d0-b4c3-821f7bb8dbe5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=474b1f38901e5daff558726476880a8c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you for opening up requests again. I would like to ask if you can draw my two OC girls. One is a raccoon you've made previous, Diciembre. Here are her references: https://imgur.com/a/woKAWK2\n\nAnd her friend, October the Dalmatian: https://imgur.com/a/RaSM1uY\n\nI would like to ask for the two to be posing together like a photo on the beach. I'd like to ask that October the Dog is messy and is holding up a shovel that shows she has been digging. Something similar to this: https://files.catbox.moe/g60k0v.jpg\n\nFeel free to decide on their swimsuits as well as the perspective of the request. I enjoy your art style and am excited to see how the pair would come out together. Thank you!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@lmnoof/works/42", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/09545043/uploads/origins/196405b4-54ea-4bb9-b9ab-055cd7885e97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a74a9290f0c7b523929ce081ad5f6f6f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/09545043/uploads/origins/196405b4-54ea-4bb9-b9ab-055cd7885e97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2C