osed tummy and tail are very soft and fluffy, and he has big paws\nwould like him to be wearing this outfit!\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/sh/5gi2qabp1d8jixu/AABoT_qjqnhajEyqV8EG70rra?dl=0\npose and details are up to you, I would like you to draw him cute, cheery and blushing\nit can be a little provocative like this picture!\nhttps://skeb.jp/@lmnoof/works/10\nI also like this picture a lot, the chibi character is very cute! https://skeb.jp/@lmnoof/works/36\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/ptegh93iamd1ay1hh2dq5/h?rlkey=3d0nfy6wb2adchut9h65s0hlb&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@lmnoof/works/40", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d6a38fb1/uploads/origins/cab600df-0d83-4632-80a9-a6d3a0d690ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22990b9043f3449aabe9d482a345fd37", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d6a38fb1/uploads/origins/cab600df-0d83-4632-80a9-a6d3a0d690ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22990b9043f3449aabe9d482a345fd37, https://si.imgix.net/d6a38fb1/uploads/origins/cab600df-0d83-4632-80a9-a6d3a0d690ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=98d94b74640211470d2ffd6d7366c5fc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d6a38fb1/uploads/origins/cab600df-0d83-4632-80a9-a6d3a0d690ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ca03baf89f804e5407d89fbaf914b90 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "またまたこんにちは。私はあなたが私のために行った最後のskebが本当に大好きですhttps://twitter.com/i3un2/status/1622623547280736256、私はあなたに私の友人のキャラクターで同じことをやってほしいですhttps://x.com/WhyWhyOUO/status/1680515950913658885 彼はskebのリクエストのために彼のキャラクターを使用する私の許可を与えた。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@lmnoof/works/39", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a0d68e09/uploads/origins/41c28ff2-c1af-4da0-95bd-28e128f19520?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e8f47064a4c985b8ee5d24727a5004a", "thumbnail_srcset": "htt